WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:49.050
Someone once said...

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:54.790
There are slightly sweet tasting zucchini

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:59.730
mixed in with a deep, rich cheese flavor...

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:03.970
Cheezucchini!

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:10.340
There are fruit of high 
quality rice cake dumplings

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:14.040
topped by top-class, deeply sweet bean paste,

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:17.780
mixed together with the taste of cherries...

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:21.750
Cherrycake Dumplings!

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:25.590
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:30.620
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:35.000
On one hand is Toriko's group,

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.730
who continued through Ice Hell 
in search of the Century Soup.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.230
Although the extreme environment 
stood in their way,

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:43.640
they successfully reached the Ice Mountain.

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:49.710
And chasing after them is the Insect 
Beast master, Tommyrod's group.

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:54.610
On the other hand, Tina and 
Zonge's group had good luck

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.250
and found a secret cave while 
being chased by an Ice Jaguar.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:02.590
Just then, a mysterious masked 
man arrived on the mountain!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:09.090
The Explosive Fire Shakes Ice Mountain! 
The Identity of the Masked Man!

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.070
Also known as the Gourmet Curtain.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:22.270
It's an aurora made from the wind 
wafting up from the Century Soup.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.380
We gotta find that first.

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:26.010
The Gourmet Curtain...

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.250
The aurora will show us the way...

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.350
It's almost like a curtain opening

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.990
on a restaurant that's 
been closed for 100 years,

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:38.020
drawing in the customers toward the soup...

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.630
You make it sound like a real fairy tale...

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:43.960
It is!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.560
The ice is pretty, too!

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:48.930
As long as wild beasts don't show up, 
this place is totally a wonderland!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.570
Just look at how this 
is sparkling incredibly!

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.390
Silver Grizzly (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 20

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.420
I've never seen this beast before!

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:35.710
Iron - Fat - Sugar - Calculating

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.510
Silver Grizzly: Height 14m, Weight 9t

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:41.450
A Silver Grizzly! Looks delicious!

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.550
This'll be some excellent protein!

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:53.600
I give thanks to all this 
world's great bounty...

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.160
Time to eat!

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:04.940
Fork!

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.350
Knife!

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.990
Thank you for the meal.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.810
These are some icicle 
scallions I found before...

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:49.050
Add in the Iciscallions...

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:52.790
Finished! Stewed Silver Grizzly!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.360
Why, doesn't that look tasty!

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:57.020
Smells lovely!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.260
Thank you for the food!

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:03.830
Yum!

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.930
This Silver Grizzly meat...

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:09.840
It tastes as delicate as 
whitefish, but chewy and juicy!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.910
The slight spiciness of the Iciscallions 
combined with the piping hot meat

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.510
melts my body from the inside!

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.080
This is really something!

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.550
Warms you up...

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:22.280
Right?

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:23.080
Yeah!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.120
Komatsu, fill her up!

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.250
That was fast!

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:32.520
Better put in more meat... 
Toriko-san's gonna eat it all.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:36.800
Toriko-san, please don't be so hasty.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:40.470
Toriko-san, I told you... Don't be so pushy!

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.870
That ain't me.

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:50.040
What?!

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:52.140
It's a baby Wall Penguin!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.610
That's rare!

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.880
W-Wall Penguin?

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.990
I-It's so cute!

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:08.490
That thing's an endangered species!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.560
I guess it's gotten lost.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.970
Oww...

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:16.770
Owwww...

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:21.100
Why, you little... What do 
you think you're doin'...

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:25.710
Baby Wall Penguins don't 
have any sense of fear.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.780
They'll take a liking to anything.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.810
But in return, the adults are fearsome.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:34.180
I bet they're frantically searching 
for this guy right now.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.790
Seriously?

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:42.290
They're totally gonna think you 
kidnapped the kid... Totally.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:51.870
Now then... Sorry, but I'll 
be turning in first thing.

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:54.040
I have to save my stamina...

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:56.070
...for when the time comes.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:01.810
A baby penguin separated from its 
parents? Better take good care of it.

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.250
Match-san...

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.420
Take a good rest, Match.

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:13.660
Toriko... The time may come 
when we have to fight.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:17.960
I might not be able to win,

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:21.500
but I need to keep enough power in 
reserve to at least surprise him.

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.000
U-Um...

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:29.700
Why did all of you come here 
to get the Century Soup?

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.710
Sorry to ask...

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:38.250
Have you heard of Nerg City?

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:42.080
A city of Gourmet criminals that 
refused to join the IGO, Nerg.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.520
A lawless city where illegal-to-distribute 
ingredients flow freely...

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.390
We can never forget it...

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:51.690
When we were kids, Match-san had 
mercy on us and handed out food.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.900
There ain't nothin' like how 
grateful we felt back then.

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:57.560
It was the first time we knew 
the happiness of eating.

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:04.540
I get it now... So it was because of 
that debt you joined the Gourmet Mafia.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.370
No, it wasn't that.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:09.610
We admire Match-san.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.050
That man's special.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:23.490
Nerg is so poor because of bad guys 
who unfairly control the food supply.

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:40.310
He couldn't take it anymore.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:43.610
He was amazing! He took 
'em all on by himself!

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:52.720
And then, he passed out the food he took.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:58.160
To think an adult in that city 
would actually do that...

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:02.530
If your stomach's empty, it's only 
natural to eat your fill, right?

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.600
First off, eat up.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.800
Good guys, bad guys... That comes later.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.640
It's true, we're hated in this society.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:14.070
But I think there's something 
wrong with that...

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.040
When the monopolization of ingredients 
causes victims to suffer...

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.340
We kids never did anything to deserve it.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:23.380
I think it's wonderful!

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:26.720
That feeling of wanting to 
let those kids eat the soup!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.950
We're just doin' it 'cause we want to.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:37.990
But to put yourself in such danger, with 
such a high Capture Level ingredient...

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.800
What about you, Takimaru?

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:46.570
Do the other Gourmet Knights 
know about this job?

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:50.110
It's the Century Soup!

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:53.180
I think it's quite a fancy 
ingredient for a Gourmet Knight,

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:57.010
whose teachings emphasize 
frugal and simple fare.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:00.580
The other members don't know about this job.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:02.380
I figured as much.

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:07.320
And besides, this isn't a job 
to give to some young recruit.

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:11.660
You haven't even told Ai about this?

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:15.930
Aimaru-san? I can't tell him, especially...

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:19.600
Why'd you take on this big job by yourself?

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:22.200
I-I need the money.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:26.370
A great deal of money... The 
country of healing, Life...

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:30.010
It's to buy medicine they sell there.

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:33.580
A medicine that is said to 
be able to cure any disease.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.080
In other words, you're 
trying to save someone.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:40.090
Putting yourself in danger for others? 
You're no different than we are.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.190
But I thought the Gourmet 
Knights forgo medicine...

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:44.190
Right...

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:49.260
We are taught to leave 
our lives up to nature...

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:53.100
Taking artificial medicine is forbidden...

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:57.540
But in the country of healing, Life,

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:00.210
they have a great deal of natural 
remedies and healing ingredients!

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:02.140
Those don't go against our teachings!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.810
I will get them, for sure!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.280
No matter how much money 
it takes... Without fail...

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:13.650
Aimaru-san... Please wait 
for just a little longer.

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:15.620
Without fail...

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:18.390
T-Takimaru-san...

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:20.490
I won't ask for details.

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:26.300
But those tears are worth just as 
much as the Century Soup, Takimaru.

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:30.940
Don't worry. If you've got a 
reason enough to cry about...

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:34.070
And you guys, too!

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:39.150
When working for the sake of others, 
people become even stronger!

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:43.880
All of us are gonna get 
the Century Soup, you bet!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.990
Don't worry! We'll find it for sure!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:47.920
Toriko-san!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:48.990
Toriko-san...

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.090
Toriko-san...

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:55.290
Speaking of which... What's your 
reason for searching for the soup?

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.430
Isn't it obvious?

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:01.370
'Cause I want to eat it! That's all!

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.770
But Toriko-san is being serious!

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.740
Takimaru-san, that's not 
something to laugh at.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.410
He's really taken a liking to you.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:16.110
Better take responsibility 
and look after him!

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:17.280
But...

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:19.980
What'll I do if its parents come?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.150
I bet they'd attack you!

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:25.620
'Cause you want to eat it yourself?

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.960
It's also because you also want 
to let Chef Komatsu eat it...

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:31.960
Guess I'll sleep.

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:37.800
Crap... This place is like a maze of ice.

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:42.210
It's going to be a bear to find 
the aurora from here, Tommy-sama.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.510
Yeah, what a pain.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.780
Maybe I'll blow this mountain up?

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:50.850
Hatch, my Bomb Bugs!

00:13:56.490 --> 00:14:01.290
Bomb Bug (Insect Beast) Capture Level 10

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:04.430
Don't set them off yet, please!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:11.870
Be born, Spark Cricket!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:17.340
Spark Cricket (Insect Beast) Capture Level 25

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:22.580
Switch... on!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.430
What was that?

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.030
What the...

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:45.570
Get everything ready! We're 
heading straight out!

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:49.170
It's the enemy! That's how we should think.

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:49.970
Enemy?

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:52.810
An opponent trying to steal 
this ingredient from us...

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:55.980
That explosion was likely their doing.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:59.180
You just had to show up, Gourmet Corp.!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.630
That didn't take long, Coco.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:22.800
I'm glad to see you doing well, Chief Mansom.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.570
Hey Ricky, how's it been?

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:27.510
So I'm the only one who came?

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:33.310
I couldn't get in contact with Sunny, 
and we can't let Zebra out of prison...

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:36.380
This is about capturing 
the Century Soup, yes?

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:39.650
Seems you've used your excellent fortune 
telling to predict the situation.

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:44.020
This time, the Gourmet Corp. probably 
sent some serious forces...

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:51.200
Toriko is in danger alone. 
Coco, head there at once!

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:57.000
Let's hurry!

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:57.570
Right!

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.140
Um...

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:07.680
Toriko-san... What should I 
do about this little penguin?

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:10.150
If it's comin' along, you 
don't have much choice.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.190
But you'd better take good care of it.

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:14.620
Now let's go!

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.050
Right...

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:19.890
Hey, you... Could you 
follow me quietly, please?

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:25.230
What was that explosion just now?

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:28.000
In other words, an event has been triggered!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:31.670
As expected from Zonge-sama! Always 
with the sharp analytic skills!

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.240
I see... So we've gotten 
to the climax of the RPG...

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.470
Wow.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:41.510
I seriously want to reset this 
adventure and start a new game.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.280
Look at that light!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.880
That's an exit if I ever saw one!

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:50.950
We'll use this secret cave 
to acquire the Century Soup!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:54.390
That explosion was to mark 
the beginning of that event!

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:56.790
Yippee! All hail Zonge-sama!

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:59.460
Don't tell me we really 
found the Century Soup?

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.200
That's a scoop of epic proportions!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.830
We've arrived!

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:11.440
What is it? Where's the Century Soup?

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:25.120
It's the Last Boss!

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:31.830
Don't speak.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.300
It's possible that the more you speak,

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.400
the less confidence people will have in you.

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.170
The mouth is not for spouting words.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.610
Its role should be only one of eating.

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:51.610
...is how I always think, anyway.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:53.950
But my master is always callin' me "gloomy"

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.220
or says "I can't tell what 
the heck you're thinkin'"

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.290
or "you a dimwit, keepin' 
totally silent, or what?"

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:01.220
But they say the mouth is 
the source of disaster!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.220
I think nothing good comes from speaking.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:06.230
I mean, there's definitely times when 
keeping silent is best, you know?

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.060
Anyway, I'm not good with words.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:12.200
Sometimes I'm careless and my mouth 
just overruns with dirty jokes...

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.400
Maybe it's really best not to talk so much...

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.810
He can't keep his clap shut!

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.470
So, people...

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:22.340
Why the silent treatment?

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:29.250
Why, you! Who the heck are you?

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:35.590
He clammed up!

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:40.490
The Gourmet Show Window is quite amazing...

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:43.360
W-Wait, you don't mean...

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:46.300
This is the Gourmet Show Window?

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.770
No, this isn't it.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.570
It isn't?

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:55.270
This beast is Hellboros, the 
sleeping master of Ice Hell.

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:56.880
Hellboros (Reptilian Beast) Capture Level 72

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.680
It was Knocked 100 years 
ago and froze to ice.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:03.880
It shouldn't be so thin at this point...

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.190
For Hellboros to be used up this much...

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:12.960
...means that a considerable amount 
of broth has been squeezed out.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:13.990
This is bad...

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:19.900
With this much, who knows how much broth 
is left in the Gourmet Show Window?

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.730
I must hurry...

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:26.470
Hold it, you! Tell us your name!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.540
I've spoken too much today.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.540
Maybe next time!

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:34.250
That guy is so...

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.820
The Century Soup is near!

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:47.290
I can smell it!

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.060
I bet it's right around here!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:52.260
You can tell? But we 
haven't seen the aurora...

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:55.330
I remember the smell from 
Granny Setsu's place!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:00.540
Are they trying to destroy 
the Gourmet Show Window?

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:04.310
Be careful, everyone! Something's coming!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:14.850
Jungle Stag Beetle (Insect 
Beast) Capture Level 38

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.290
Komatsu!

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:38.540
Men!

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:41.780
So fast...

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:47.420
Flying Knife!

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:53.160
Toriko-san!

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:57.030
What the...

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.630
I've found you...

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.910
Now let's go, you two!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:20.580
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:24.850
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:28.220
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:31.690
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:35.060
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:38.130
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:41.900
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.470
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:48.610
Two-way communication!

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:52.110
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:55.880
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:59.250
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.090
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:05.790
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:09.360
Fight with bravery!

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:13.070
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:17.470 --> 00:22:19.370
Gourmet News!

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:22.240
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:23.510
The Silver Grizzly,

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:28.210
whose meat takes like perfect canned 
mackerel when you pickle it in vinegar!

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:32.580
Today I'll be teaching you a method to 
savor that flavor easily yourselves!

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:37.660
Eating tuna and pickled kelp together 
tastes like canned mackerel!

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:43.260
It tastes like canned mackerel!

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.800
This'll make rice taste even better!

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:50.200
Bread? Not rice?

00:22:53.370 --> 00:22:55.770
It tastes like a canned mackerel sandwich!

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.980
This isn't so bad either!

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:02.750
I just can't help a little pickled kelp!

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:05.020
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.000
The Gourmet Show Window is finally found!

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:13.080
And the bell is rung to start the all-out battle over the Century Soup!

00:23:13.670 --> 00:23:16.830
Glorious Bug Tamer! Tommyrod vs Toriko!

00:23:17.070 --> 00:23:18.840
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
